       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.    SWI56402.
      ******************************************************************
      *     PROGRAMA SWI56402.
      *
      *     Anulação da reconciliação
      ******************************************************************
      *     LOG ALTERACOES:                                            *
      *   USER     / DATA     /   REFERENCIA / OBSERVACOES             *
      *                                                                *
      *                                                                *
      ******************************************************************
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       DATA DIVISION.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  FILLER                          PIC X(40) VALUE
           'INICIO WORKING-STORAGE SWI56402         '.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            DECLARACOES DE DB2
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SWCD7204 END-EXEC.
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SQLCA    END-EXEC.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            MENSAGEM DE INPUT E  OUTPUT
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       COPY SWCV5640.
       COPY SWCV5641.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            AREAS DE TRABALHO
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       COPY VIAL0015.
       COPY VIAW0005.
       COPY VIAK0001.
       COPY VIAK0002.
       COPY SWCK0001.
       COPY SWCK0002.

       COPY AQCW0005.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            CONSTANTES
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  WS-CONSTANTES.
           05 CON-SWVT7204 PIC X(08) VALUE 'SWVT7204'.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            VARIAVEIS
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  WS-VARIAVEIS.
           05 FILLER                       PIC  X(01) VALUE SPACES.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            PROGRAM CONTROL
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  WS-PROGRAM-CONTROL.
           05 WS-PROGNAME                  PIC  X(08) VALUE 'SWI56402'.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  FILLER                          PIC X(40) VALUE
           'FIM DA WORKING-STORAGE SWI56402         '.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       LINKAGE SECTION.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------

       COPY VIAL0004.

            EXEC SQL INCLUDE VIAP0009 END-EXEC.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            0000-MAINLINE
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       0000-MAINLINE.

           PERFORM 1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA
              THRU 1099-INICIO-PROGRAMA-EXIT.

           PERFORM 2000-PROC-PROGRAMA
              THRU 2099-PROC-PROGRAMA-EXIT.

           PERFORM 3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA
              THRU 3099-FINAL-PROGRAMA-EXIT.

       0099-MAINLINE-EXIT.
           COPY VIAP0004.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA.

           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA'  TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE VIAL0001-MENSAGEM-INPUT    TO SWCV5640-MSG.
           MOVE SWCV5640-ASE               TO SWCV5641-ASE.

       1099-INICIO-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            2000-PROC-PROGRAMA
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2000-PROC-PROGRAMA.

           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2000-PROC-PROGRAMA'    TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE SWCV5640-ADE               TO SWCV5641-ADE.

           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2100-OBTEM-DADOS
                 THRU 2199-OBTEM-DADOS-EXIT
           END-IF.

       2099-PROC-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                   2100-OBTEM-DADOS
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2100-OBTEM-DADOS.

           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2100-OBTEM-DADOS'      TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE SWCV5640-MRNOPR            TO SWCD7204-MRNOPR.
           MOVE SWCV5640-MRNORD            TO SWCD7204-MRNORD.
           MOVE SWCV5640-IDRECON           TO SWCD7204-IDRECONC.

           EXEC SQL
              SELECT
                     MRBALC
                   , MRCCB
                   , NCCCCBAN
                   , NCCCCSPAI
                   , NCCCCCONTA
                   , MRTDOC
                   , MRCOPE
                   , MRNDOC
                   , MRVLR
                   , MRSALD
                   , MRUSER
                   , MRDTSIS
                   , MRHORA
                   , MRDATL
                   , MRDRCX
                   , MRETRB
                   , MRBALM
                   , MROBS
                   , MRNOPR
                   , MRNOPS
                   , MRNORD
                   , MREANL
                   , MRDTCB
                   , MREXCT
                   , MRMOED
                   , MRDMOV
                   , GBMRINFC
                   , CCHAVE
                   , IRECONC
                   , CCODMSG
                   , DATVAL
                   , COSN
                   , COSNC
                   , CREF
                   , CREFOPR
                   , CTIPREC
      *            , GOBS
                   , CUSERID
                   , HTIMEST
                   , IDRECONC
                INTO :SWCD7204-MRBALC
                   , :SWCD7204-MRCCB
                   , :SWCD7204-NCCCCBAN
                   , :SWCD7204-NCCCCSPAI
                   , :SWCD7204-NCCCCCONTA
                   , :SWCD7204-MRTDOC
                   , :SWCD7204-MRCOPE
                   , :SWCD7204-MRNDOC
                   , :SWCD7204-MRVLR
                   , :SWCD7204-MRSALD
                   , :SWCD7204-MRUSER
                   , :SWCD7204-MRDTSIS
                   , :SWCD7204-MRHORA
                   , :SWCD7204-MRDATL
                   , :SWCD7204-MRDRCX
                   , :SWCD7204-MRETRB
                   , :SWCD7204-MRBALM
                   , :SWCD7204-MROBS
                   , :SWCD7204-MRNOPR
                   , :SWCD7204-MRNOPS
                   , :SWCD7204-MRNORD
                   , :SWCD7204-MREANL
                   , :SWCD7204-MRDTCB
                   , :SWCD7204-MREXCT
                   , :SWCD7204-MRMOED
                   , :SWCD7204-MRDMOV
                   , :SWCD7204-GBMRINFC
                   , :SWCD7204-CCHAVE
                   , :SWCD7204-IRECONC
                   , :SWCD7204-CCODMSG
                   , :SWCD7204-DATVAL
                   , :SWCD7204-COSN
                   , :SWCD7204-COSNC
                   , :SWCD7204-CREF
                   , :SWCD7204-CREFOPR
                   , :SWCD7204-CTIPREC
      *            , :SWCD7204-GOBS
                   , :SWCD7204-CUSERID
                   , :SWCD7204-HTIMEST
                   , :SWCD7204-IDRECONC
                FROM SWVT7204
               WHERE MRNOPR  =  :SWCD7204-MRNOPR
                 AND MRNORD  =  :SWCD7204-MRNORD
                 AND IDRECONC = :SWCD7204-IDRECONC
           END-EXEC.

           MOVE CON-SWVT7204               TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME.

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.

           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              IF DB2-OK
                 IF VIAL0001-CRIACAO
                    MOVE VIAK0002-ERROS-FUNCAO
                      TO VIAL0002-IND-ERROS
                    MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO
                      TO SWCV5641-MRNOPR-S
                    MOVE SWCK0001-NOPR-EXISTS
                      TO SWCV5641-MRNOPR-MSG
                    MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC
                      TO SWCV5641-MRNOPR-CAPLIC
                 ELSE
                    MOVE SWCD7204-MRBALC   TO SWCV5641-MRBALC
                    MOVE SWCD7204-MRCCB    TO SWCV5641-MRCCB
                    MOVE SWCD7204-MRTDOC   TO SWCV5641-MRTDOC
                    MOVE SWCD7204-MRCOPE   TO SWCV5641-MRCOPE
                    MOVE SWCD7204-MRNDOC   TO SWCV5641-MRNDOC
                    MOVE SWCD7204-MRVLR    TO SWCV5641-MRVLR
                    MOVE SWCD7204-MRSALD   TO SWCV5641-MRSALD
                    MOVE SWCD7204-MRUSER   TO SWCV5641-MRUSER
                    MOVE SWCD7204-MRDTSIS  TO AQCW0005-DT98
                    PERFORM AQCP0005-CONV-DT8INDT10
                       THRU AQCP0005-CONV-DT8INDT10-EXIT
                    MOVE AQCW0005-DTX10    TO SWCV5641-MRDTSIS
                    MOVE SWCD7204-MRDATL   TO AQCW0005-DT98
                    PERFORM AQCP0005-CONV-DT8INDT10
                       THRU AQCP0005-CONV-DT8INDT10-EXIT
                    MOVE AQCW0005-DTX10    TO SWCV5641-MRDATL
                    MOVE SWCD7204-MRDRCX   TO SWCV5641-MRDRCX
                    MOVE SWCD7204-MRETRB   TO SWCV5641-MRETRB
                    MOVE SWCD7204-MRBALM   TO SWCV5641-MRBALM
                    MOVE SWCD7204-MROBS    TO SWCV5641-MROBS
                    MOVE SWCD7204-MRNOPR   TO SWCV5641-MRNOPR
                    MOVE SWCD7204-MRNOPS   TO SWCV5641-MRNOPS
                    MOVE SWCD7204-MRNORD   TO SWCV5641-MRNORD
                    MOVE SWCD7204-MREANL   TO SWCV5641-MREANL
                    MOVE SWCD7204-MRDTCB   TO SWCV5641-MRDTCB
                    MOVE SWCD7204-MREXCT   TO SWCV5641-MREXCT
                    MOVE SWCD7204-MRMOED   TO SWCV5641-MRMOED
                    MOVE SWCD7204-MRDMOV   TO SWCV5641-MRDMOV
                    MOVE SWCD7204-GBMRINFC TO SWCV5641-GBMRINFC
                    MOVE SWCD7204-IRECONC  TO SWCV5641-IRECONC
                    MOVE SWCD7204-CCODMSG  TO SWCV5641-CCODMSGX
                    MOVE SWCD7204-DATVAL   TO AQCW0005-DT98
                    PERFORM AQCP0005-CONV-DT8INDT10
                       THRU AQCP0005-CONV-DT8INDT10-EXIT
                    MOVE AQCW0005-DTX10    TO SWCV5641-DATVALX
                    MOVE SWCD7204-COSN     TO SWCV5641-COSNX
                    MOVE SWCD7204-COSNC    TO SWCV5641-COSNCX
                    MOVE SWCD7204-CREF     TO SWCV5641-CREFX
                    MOVE SWCD7204-CREFOPR  TO SWCV5641-CREFOPRX
                    MOVE SWCD7204-CTIPREC  TO SWCV5641-CTIPREC
      *             MOVE SWCD7204-GOBS     TO SWCV5641-GOBS
                    MOVE SWCD7204-IDRECONC TO SWCV5641-IDRECON
      *             IF SWCD7204-IRECONC NOT EQUAL SWCK0002-IRECONC-SIM
      *                MOVE VIAK0002-ERROS-FUNCAO
      *                  TO VIAL0002-IND-ERROS
      *                MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO
      *                  TO SWCV5641-MRNOPR-S
      *                MOVE SWCK0001-NOPR-N-EXISTS
      *                  TO SWCV5641-MRNOPR-MSG
      *                MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC
      *                  TO SWCV5641-MRNOPR-CAPLIC
      *             END-IF
                    IF NOT VIAL0001-VISUALIZACAO
                        CONTINUE
                    END-IF
                 END-IF
              ELSE
                 IF NOT VIAL0001-CRIACAO
                    MOVE VIAK0002-ERROS-FUNCAO
                      TO VIAL0002-IND-ERROS
                    MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO
                      TO SWCV5641-MRNOPR-S
                    MOVE SWCK0001-NOPR-N-EXISTS
                      TO SWCV5641-MRNOPR-MSG
                    MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC
                      TO SWCV5641-MRNOPR-CAPLIC
                 END-IF
              END-IF
           END-IF.

       2199-OBTEM-DADOS-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA.

           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA'   TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE SWCV5641-MSG               TO VIAL0001-MENSAGEM-OUTPUT.
           MOVE SWCV5641-LENGTH            TO VIAL0001-LENGTH-MSG.
           MOVE SWCV5641-NR-CAMPOS         TO VIAL0001-NR-CAMPOS.
           MOVE ZEROES
             TO VIAL0001-OCORRENCIAS.

       3099-FINAL-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE VIAP0003 END-EXEC.
      *==============================================================
           COPY VIAP0016.
           COPY AQCP0005.
